"""Game texts added on 2026-10-18 that the packs didn't cover yet, part F (2026-10-18, i18n catch-up: the guild, invite and
network-error texts, the sign-in screen, the leaderboard, the Nest hint and the Creative / Creativity keyword). Plain texts and
{placeholder} templates together; the rules for a template row are those of i18n_2026_10_18d.py (every {placeholder} kept,
side-by-side placeholders such as "{n}{where}" kept side by side and in order). Also "Join a Guild" and "Join", the guild screen's
heading and button, so the half-done-guild message points at words the player can find on screen.
Same caveats as i18n_core.py (Tagalog, Tamil, Japanese and Korean deserve a native read).

    python3 tools/i18n_2026_10_18f.py && python3 tools/i18n_refresh.py
"""
